  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Yeese is a European-inspired fashion brand dedicated to modern plus-size women. Founded in 2025, we design comfortable, flattering, and well-made clothing that supports real bodies and everyday life. Our collections focus on timeless silhouettes, inclusive fits, and quality fabrics inspired by Scandinavian simplicity.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Yeese is created by experienced designers who understand fit, movement, and confidence. We don’t follow fast fashion trends—instead, we design pieces women can truly wear, trust, and return to again and again.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn commission for every qualified sale generated through their unique referral links. We offer competitive commission rates and reliable tracking via UpPromote.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Affiliates can promote Yeese through blogs, social media, content websites, reviews, and styling recommendations. We welcome authentic content that highlights comfort, fit, and real-life wear.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We provide regular promotions, seasonal discounts, and dedicated support to help our affiliates succeed and grow with the Yeese brand.</p></div></div>",
